  "body": "For privacy reasons, should the list of uuids on the BluetoothDevice be filtered to the set of services matched by BluetoothScanFilter and RequestDeviceOptions.services?\n\nE.g. if a web page requests a device that offers a heart rate service, optionally with access to battery level, should it be able to discover that OBEXObjectPush is also supported on a device, providing more data about the device than may be necessary?\n",
